OpenFig
--------

This repository is an independent personal fork of
aws/amazon-q-developer-cli-autocomplete, originally built by Fig (withfig).
It retains terminal autocomplete and zsh integration while removing product
AI/chat, account sign-in, telemetry and automatic updates. Completion specs
are bundled locally; their generators can execute user commands, including
commands that access the network. The app is not a network sandbox.

